  "title": "The Crossing Number of the Complete Bipartite Graph",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "The crossing number $cr(G)$ of $G$ is the minimum number of crossings in all drawings of $G$ in the plane.\n\nConjecture $\\displaystyle cr(K_{m,n}) = \\floor{\\frac m2} \\floor{\\frac {m-1}2} \\floor{\\frac n2} \\floor{\\frac {n-1}2}$",
